pole at the stadium, untied a specific piece of official property, and stuffed it into the bottom of his suitcase. For the next 80 years, the Olympic Committee assumed the item had been lost or destroyed during the war. It wasn't until the diver was 103 years old that he finally confessed to having it in his closet the whole time. In a special ceremony at the 2000 Games, he finally returned the contraband. What did he steal?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:50:49Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Flag", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:50:52Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Olympic", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:50:55Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "More specific", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:50:58Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "olympic flag", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:51:02Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Stole it", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:51:05Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:51:06Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "US flag", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:51:15Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Olympic flame", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:51:18Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "German flag", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:51:25Z", "username": "Abhis